   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2020-12-08",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Labor Party supported the Health Insurance Amendment (Compliance Administration) Bill 2020, which replaces the word \"statement\" with \"information\" in Medicare claims, but criticised the government's nudge letters to GPs as a blunt instrument that creates needless anxiety, noting that only a tiny fraction of providers bill inappropriately while letters were sent to hundreds or thousands of GPs."
  },
